{
  "tema": 6181,
  "slug": "dejar-de-infinitivo",
  "titulo": "Dejar de + infinitive: to stop doing something",
  "subtitulo": "Dejé de fumar: stop or give up, always with an infinitive.",
  "foto": "t07.jpg",
  "regla": "Dejar (conjugated) + de + infinitive = to stop doing, to give up doing: dejé de fumar. Never a gerund after de.",
  "comparada_kwiziq": "2026-10-10",
  "secciones": [
    {
      "id": "regla",
      "titulo": "The rule",
      "bloques": [
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "To say _to stop doing_ something, use **dejar** (conjugated) + **de** + **infinitive**."
        },
        {
          "tipo": "formula",
          "partes": [
            "**dejar**",
            "**de**",
            "infinitive"
          ]
        },
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "The **de** always comes after **dejar**, and after it comes an **infinitive**, never a gerund. English says _stop shouting_, Spanish says **deja de gritar**."
        },
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "With habits, it's usually _to give up_: **dejé de fumar** = _I gave up smoking_."
        },
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "It works in every tense: **dejé de**, **he dejado de**, **dejarán de**, **deja de**."
        },
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "Tip: **dejar** lets go, **de** points at what you let go of, and it's always an infinitive."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "ejemplos",
      "titulo": "Examples",
      "bloques": [
        {
          "tipo": "ejemplos",
          "lista": [
            {
              "es": "==Dejé de fumar== hace tres años.",
              "en": "I quit smoking three years ago."
            },
            {
              "es": "==Hemos dejado de ir== a yoga.",
              "en": "We've stopped going to yoga."
            },
            {
              "es": "¿Cuándo ==van a dejar de tomar== tanto?",
              "en": "When are you going to stop drinking so much?"
            },
            {
              "es": "¡==Deja de gritar==!",
              "en": "Stop shouting!"
            },
            {
              "es": "Beto ==dejó de entrenar== después de la lesión.",
              "en": "Beto stopped training after the injury."
            },
            {
              "es": "Por fin ==dejó de llover==.",
              "en": "It finally stopped raining."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "trampa",
      "titulo": "The trap",
      "bloques": [
        {
          "tipo": "pares",
          "lista": [
            {
              "filas": [
                {
                  "v": "mal",
                  "t": "¡Deja de gritando!"
                },
                {
                  "v": "bien",
                  "t": "¡Deja de gritar!"
                }
              ],
              "nota": "Infinitive, not gerund."
            },
            {
              "filas": [
                {
                  "v": "mal",
                  "t": "Dejé fumar."
                },
                {
                  "v": "bien",
                  "t": "Dejé de fumar."
                }
              ],
              "nota": "Never drop the **de**."
            },
            {
              "filas": [
                {
                  "v": "bien",
                  "t": "Dejé la tabla en el carro."
                }
              ],
              "nota": "Without **de**, **dejar** means _to leave_ something somewhere."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
